  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Giả sử tứ diện đều có tất cả các cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> <br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> <br>Do tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math> <br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Mặt khác\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tNên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/4960bb838b98b583036e56cc718cb1f3d90546d52f348ae6d629eddb9c36447c.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
